    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 27,
      "text": "As per the prosecution case, the applicant and co-accused persons who were the director, managing director and employee/agents of the A.D.C. India Fishery Trading Company Pvt. Ltd. through their employee/agent collected huge amount from innocent persons assuring them to double their money Rahul Chhahar vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh on 20 February, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/121408404/\n2 within a stipulated period.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2879,
      "end": 3319,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "A.D.C. India Fishery Trading Company Pvt. Ltd.",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 3013,
          "end": 3059
        },
        {
          "text": "Rahul Chhahar vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 3169,
          "end": 3213
        },
        {
          "text": "20 February, 2023",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 3217,
          "end": 3234
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4430161416530609
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 28,
      "text": "However, they did not pay the money even after the maturity period.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3320,
      "end": 3387,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.43005111813545227
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 29,
      "text": "On the other hand, they closed down the company office and embezzled crores of rupees of the investors.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3388,
      "end": 3491,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4337611794471741
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 30,
      "text": "Thus, they cheated innocent people.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3492,
      "end": 3527,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.456265926361084
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 31,
      "text": "The specific allegations against the applicants Archana Jaiswal and Mukesh are that they were the directors of the company and Rahul Chahar was also on an important post of company and they all induced the innocent people to deposit money with the company and thus they usurped crores of rupees invested by the investors.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3528,
      "end": 3849,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Archana Jaiswal",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 3576,
          "end": 3591
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukesh",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 3596,
          "end": 3602
        },
        {
          "text": "Rahul Chahar",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 3655,
          "end": 3667
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.19639095664024353
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 32,
      "text": "Learned counsel for the applicant Mukesh Kumar has submitted that applicant has not committed any offence and has falsely been implicated in the offence.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3850,
      "end": 4004,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Mukesh Kumar",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 3885,
          "end": 3897
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.132967010140419
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 33,
      "text": "It is submitted that co-accused Devendra Jaiswal and Archana Jaiswal were the director of the said company.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 4005,
      "end": 4112,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Devendra Jaiswal",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 4037,
          "end": 4053
        },
        {
          "text": "Archana Jaiswal",
          "label": "PETITIONER",
          "start": 4058,
          "end": 4073
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.15892188251018524
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 34,
      "text": "He himself had deposited a sum of Rs. 12,00,000/- in the said company.",
