      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3474730849266052
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 52,
      "text": "The prayer for bail is made only on the ground that some of witnesses, who have been examined before the trail Court have not stated anything against him but have deposed only against Devendra Jaiswal and Archana Jaiswal, therefore, they be released on bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
