      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.36944931745529175
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 53,
      "text": "Such prayer is not worth acceptance as while considering the second bail application High Court is not expected to appreciate the evidence of witnesses examined before the trial Court as it is for the trial Court to appreciate the reliability and truthfulness of the evidence of the prosecution witnesses.",
